{"id":"n1608972969","headline":"LPG Aadhaar e-KYC: October 1 deadline for subsidised refills, what consumers need to know","summary":"Domestic cooking gas consumers in India must complete biometric Aadhaar authentication by October 1, 2026, to keep buying refills at subsidised prices. The Ministry of Petroleum and Natural Gas issued the statement.","why":"LPG subsidies are a major fiscal item in India, and changes to eligibility rules affect state oil marketing companies and household fuel costs.","category":"economy","event_type":"regulation","importance":1,"flag":null,"market_moving":false,"location":{"place":"New Delhi","country":"India","lat":28.61,"lon":77.21,"region":"asia"},"entities":[],"links":[],"source":{"name":"The Tribune","url":"https://www.tribuneindia.com/news/business/lpg-aadhaar-e-kyc-october-1-deadline-for-subsidised-refills-what-consumers-need-to-know/"},"sources":[{"name":"The Tribune","url":"https://www.tribuneindia.com/news/business/lpg-aadhaar-e-kyc-october-1-deadline-for-subsidised-refills-what-consumers-need-to-know/"}],"published_at":"2026-09-20T09:57:13Z","retrieved_at":"2026-11-11T22:35:51Z","official":false,"ai_summary":true,"content_hash":"dc54ebdfd9e40524","impacts":[],"why_moved":null,"backfilled":true,"backfilled_at":"2026-11-11T22:35:51Z","backfill_provenance":{"version":"gdelt-backfill-v1","original_published_at":"2026-09-20T09:57:13Z","feed_url":"https://data.gdeltproject.org/gdeltv2/","discovered_via":"GDELT GKG 2.1","gdelt_seen":"2026-09-20T12:00:00Z","publisher_country_gdelt":"IN","description_from":"publisher page metadata"}}